    {
      "name": "velero/velero-plugin-for-aws",
      "category": "upstream",
      "artifactType": "image",
      "management": {
        "managed": true,
        "datasource": "docker",
        "registryUrl": "https://docker.io",
        "versioning": "semver"
      },
      "value": "v1.14.4@sha256:c85a7fa803569e3128c33e4f5766f84ab156c8d171c9f1dd2715581d45ce98fa",
      "notes": [
        "v1.14.1-1.14.2 send an empty x-amz-tagging header, which Cloudflare R2 rejects with",
        "501 NotImplemented; backup-metadata uploads then fail and leave orphaned ZFS/R2 data",
        "(incidents #5860 and #5849). renovate.json excludes that broken release window.",
        "The upstream guard (velero-io/velero-plugin-for-aws#299) landed in v1.14.3. v1.14.4's",
        "buildPutObjectInput sets Tagging only when configured. Its released source passed an",
        "R2 upload/read-back/delete probe with this repository's storage-location settings.",
        "Verify the released plugin's R2 upload path before future version bumps. A successful",
        "object probe does not prove a complete Velero backup or restore."
      ],
      "component": true
    },
